00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:49.150
End of June, 1587 - Kyoto - Uchino - Jurakudai 

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:57.000
There is still some time before the Chief Advisor returns to Kyoto from Kyushu, Lord Nagamasu.

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:00.800
If he sees my mansion at the Jurakudai all adorned with flair from the southern lands,

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.690
I will not be able to contain his anger.

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.340
He has issued a ban already.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.120
We must alter our mansion immediately.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:19.160
The Chief Advisor's mansion is finished already!

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:23.830
Let me take a visit while I'm here!

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:30.190
Come On, My Juraku

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:47.210
Gold!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.330
Gold!

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.080
Gold!

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.640
This is out of the world!

00:02:56.350 --> 00:03:01.670
If the Buddha appears out of nowhere, he will feel right at home!

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:05.700
Don't be so animated like Furuori.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:10.410
Osaka Castle cannot match up to the gilded gold.

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:15.520
The moat is filled with white sand.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:18.430
That makes this more of a pavilion rather than a castle.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:23.400
The Chief Advisor is even thinking of currying the local nobles' favor.

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:27.320
He has beautifully covered up the heavy smell of gunpowder in this stronghold.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.390
That's...

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.980
The legendary three-story pagoda?

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.460
It pays homage to the Temple of the Golden Pavilion.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.640
Just like my late brother,

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:45.090
all rulers of the world want to boast of their glories and surpass Ashikaga Yoshimitsu.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:47.540
Or else they won't be satisfied.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.060
You're so serious, Lord Nagamasu.

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:54.880
The children of Kyoto won't like that.

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:55.650
Leave me alone.

00:03:57.990 --> 00:04:00.010
Let's take a look at Rikyū's mansion.

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:04.260
I think it's situated at the northeast corner, along the outer walls.

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:20.300
The Chief Advisor is pretty knowledgeable about the way of the tea.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:23.070
Not even a daimyo gets this much space!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.820
What's that hut?

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.330
A tea room that's only the size of one and a half tatami!?

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.980
This is smaller than a bathroom!

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:51.890
Too small.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:55.270
This is smaller than that Taian.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:03.200
This is like a direct slash at the Chief Advisor's throat.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.370
"You seem to be interested in the gaudy. You are not fit to run this country."

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.770
That is the meaning of this small room.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:18.470
Even a fan of luxury like me feels like wanting to change his interests after seeing this.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.930
I have to change my mansion, in any case.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:27.550
Is the world turning towards Rikyū's vision?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.640
Chikuzen Province, Hakozaki - Pine Groves of Chiyo

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.620
What rustic beauty!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:11.580
He is not using a wind furnace to make a fire. He is only using pine leaves and branches!

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:14.790
He places the teapot adorned with the dragon of the clouds directly on top of the burning pine.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.250
He doesn't even need a room or a window.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.510
This is only possible with the warm climate.

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:27.190
I cannot surpass this.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:31.860
The Master's simplicity has transcended to this level!?

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:36.670
You've done something unbelievable again.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.240
If I may interject,

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:43.320
you can see the smoke from these pine leaves and the view of the great sea.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:46.000
Please enjoy them both.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:52.140
I never thought having a tea ceremony outdoors can be this great.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.410
You sound tired, Chief Advisor.

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:01.320
It's about Ukon.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:04.940
I had already planned to compromise.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:09.210
He wouldn't have been exiled if he had only supported me on the outside.

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:14.650
Lord Takayama is a bit fastidious sometimes.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:19.960
It's a shame he couldn't accept your kindness.

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:25.780
Sōji, Ukon... Your disciples are all too crazy.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.720
Like a certain master?

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:34.040
I am not here to jostle words with you.

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:36.190
I am here to compliment, actually.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:43.440
I had been interested in all things foreign.

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:46.870
But I realized something from a certain incident.

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:52.230
The beauty of Japan is the most beautiful of all things.

00:07:56.170 --> 00:08:00.160
Isn't that what you are yearning for?

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:02.840
I applaud your perseverance.

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.510
An idea came to me.

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:20.470
You have a potter named Chōjirō working for you, am I right?

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.860
I want to move his workshop to the Jurakudai.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.860
I want to spread the new beauty of Japan with him.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:32.620
It'll be a new style, the Juraku ware.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:39.230
You don't seem happy at all?

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:42.070
Your beauty has won.

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:44.120
Please.

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:49.030
That's not all.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:55.140
I have conquered Kyushu and acquired the Triumvirate.

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:57.310
I must display my accomplishments.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:01.930
I will hold a tea ceremony on a scale never seen before!

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:06.830
I will gather all aesthetes of imperfection from all over to Kyoto.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:12.970
I will show what true beauty is to those who have been drunk with the flair of the southern lands!

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.090
I'll leave the preparations to you.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:18.160
Make it wild!

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.140
Scare the shit out of them!

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:32.700
Lord Furuori.

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:34.740
Lord Furuori.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.130
Lord Tadaoki?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.280
Can you let me see it?

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:43.500
The tea bowl given to you!

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:46.080
I heard it was a golden tea bowl.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.480
Well...

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:50.430
Please show it to me!

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:55.480
Ever since I joined Lord Hidenaga, I have nothing gained from my efforts!

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:58.650
Come a bit closer.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:13.870
Not bad, eh?

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:15.630
Holy wow.

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:21.120
This tea bowl can only be beautiful when paired with a golden tea room.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:25.900
This unadulterated brilliance is enough to melt your transient heart away.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:30.120
That's why I don't want others to see it.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.740
What a tea bowl!

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:38.220
Master Kamiya Sōtan.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:44.870
Even as a merchant from Hakata, we don't see something like this.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:49.320
Please let me touch it...

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.890
Seems like a lot of people want that bowl.

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:04.480
If you can keep this a secret from the Chief Advisor,

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:08.330
it may be possible for you to have it.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.800
Of course, I demand a high price.

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:16.820
Really!?

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:29.200
I will stop by the capital often.

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:32.380
Please keep in touch.

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:35.360
Likewise.

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:46.470
July, 1587 - Yamashiro Province, West Hills, 
Residence of Furuta Oribe

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:53.160
I'll be lonely, Sasuke.

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:57.910
It has only been a few days since you returned from Kyushu.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.870
You'll be heading for your mansion at the Jurakudai.

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:04.400
The children and I will have to stay here at Osaka Castle.

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:08.440
Hang in there, Osen.

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:13.320
All of the other daimyo are leaving their wives and children at Osaka Castle, too.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:17.190
It's nothing. Kyoto isn't far from Osaka.

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:31.170
What will your mansion be like at the Jurakudai?

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:33.660
I'm looking forward to it, milord.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:39.220
My intricate designs will be paired up with Hasegawa Tōhaku's art.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.460
It can only be good.

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:45.040
It won't reach the level of the Chief Advisor's palace.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.630
But you are spending quite a lot.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.740
Don't talk about that.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:54.190
I am busy gathering my funds every day.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.650
I sold my gifted bowl at a high price,

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:00.870
but I gave half of it to Master Sanada.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:06.800
I still owe Lord Tokugawa quite a sum after adding up what I have left.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:12.730
Will Lord Tokugawa forgive and forget?

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:14.830
Even if the monetary debt is erased,

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:17.370
the debt from my heart will remain.

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:23.760
Meeting Kamiya Sōtan at Kyushu has been a lucky break.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:29.370
He may be able to spread my Ten Works of Oribe.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.550
This is... Lord Hosokawa's mansion?

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:54.310
The roof, the walls, the door, and even the pillars...

00:13:54.590 --> 00:13:57.430
A complete black?

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:01.760
What's the matter?

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.910
It's like a bat nest!

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:10.800
This is way too much, even if the Master likes black.

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:14.020
Just the paint must have cost a fortune.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.520
The indiscretion of youth is fearsome, indeed.

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:21.580
This area will be in a perpetual state of mourning.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.910
I think you are being a bit too rude there.

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:34.630
And this is...

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.740
Lord Nagamasu's mansion?

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:45.960
Still fixing things up?

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:52.040
He is trying to fix the flair of the southern lands after hearing about the ban.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.480
This is...

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:10.670
The goddess Benten?

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:14.910
I heard it was a goddess from the southern lands before.

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:21.270
Those round shapes look a lot like nipples.

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:26.580
Now that his wife is not living with him,

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:31.090
I'm sure he's going to try and lure some girls into this dirty house.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:37.750
Hey! Scram!

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:40.130
That's fine.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.260
Children are so honest.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.620
They can tell if a mansion is good or bad.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.980
I got this.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.930
There are about 300 mansions here.

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:54.110
My mansion is the very best.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:16:01.740
I, Furuta Oribe the aesthete, will shake the heavens!

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.800
This is Lord Furuta's mansion.

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:13.360
What intricate detail.

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.570
I think it's great how I cannot see what's so good about it at first glance.

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:20.180
I don't think anything can represent transience more.

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:24.900
What's the matter, Master Rikyū?

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.520
Master Rikyū?

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.230
Oh, it's Lord Furuta!

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:07.750
Let us take a look inside!

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:13.180
Master Rikyū and Master Tōhaku.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:17.450
Master Tōhaku invited me here.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:25.940
I already decided that I will guide you when you first arrive here.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.350
I see.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:32.520
How is it, Master?

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:36.920
It was a lot of work to display the beauty of these wilted leaves.

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:42.300
I burned these pillars, and then painted them.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:46.290
After leaving them alone for a while they turned amber.

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:51.770
I hammered these walls first to create beautiful fissures.

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:55.680
Then I had metal strips adorned onto them so they don't lose integrity.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:02.070
Seeing Master Hechikan's residence left a big impression on me.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:09.340
It took quite the work to engineer the beauty of a tattered residence.

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:15.500
I think he's taunting me a bit too much here.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:20.880
Though I admit there is a certain appeal here not expressible with words.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:31.850
He's jealous!

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:35.120
Master is jealous of my mansion!

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:36.630
It's happening!

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:40.990
The peak of imperfection is right in front of us!

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:46.760
Master Tōhaku just needs to add his finishing touches to the paper doors!

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:53.100
This is the first time here for the two of you.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.210
Please take a look.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:16.710
Lord Furuta gave me an unbelievable tea bowl to reference.

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:20.990
I could not reach the level attained by that tea bowl.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:25.990
Thus I drew circles of different sizes and colors on the paper doors.

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:37.180
I am awed by your emotional reaction.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:40.820
You damn idiot!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.060
How are these paper doors displaying imperfection!?

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:48.120
Who asked you to draw these ladybugs!?

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.220
But the tea bowl you gave me...

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:58.710
You don't understand the supple sense of simplicity!?

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:07.580
I sacrificed my life on this room...

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:10.160
Unforgivable.

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:15.650
Unforgivable!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:17.920
This is great.

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:44.950
These are all indescribable shapes.

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:51.000
You created a room that anyone can find interest in, without using gold.

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.380
You have built a mansion that cannot be imitated.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:58.540
It is full of your flair, Lord Furuori.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:00.030
I am touched.

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:11.110
Why don't you have the people from the capital come in and take a look?

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:17.200
I think you may bring them a moment of clarity in this cruel world.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:19.700
That's a great idea, Master.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:25.100
We can get some money from admission fees.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:27.910
Just like Nobunaga.

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:39.670
Well... Master Tōhaku...

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.970
I'm really sorry...

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:51.330
Let's go.

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:54.040
Let's see the rooms further inside.

00:21:57.090 --> 00:22:00.740
End of September, 1587 - Suruga Province, Numazu

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:07.050
The Chief Advisor is going all out.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:12.470
He is bringing all of the aesthetes to Kyoto and holding a huge tea ceremony.

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:17.440
Seems like he won't rest until he becomes number one at everything.

00:22:18.740 --> 00:22:22.130
But I don't think he can beat the great tea masters.

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:23.900
I disagree.

00:22:24.010 --> 00:22:28.270
I hear that there's an amazing guy, Lord Furuta Oribe.

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:32.360
He built an amazing mansion at Kyoto.

00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:43.260
That Furuori becoming the number one aesthete in the world? What a joke.

00:22:43.830 --> 00:22:46.220
Seems like it's not time for me, Yamanoue Sōji,

00:22:46.480 --> 00:22:50.910
to be traveling around after descending Mt. Kōya.

00:22:55.780 --> 00:22:59.200
I must hurry and finish my book on aesthetics.

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:06.250
Everytime I　

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:06.250
Anata no mune

00:23:06.410 --> 00:23:08.640
feel your heart

00:23:06.410 --> 00:23:08.640
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:14.730
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:14.730
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.650 --> 00:23:20.910
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.650 --> 00:23:20.910
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.760 --> 00:23:27.070
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.760 --> 00:23:27.070
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:33.160
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:33.160
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:37.040
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:37.040
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:40.620
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:40.620
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.820 --> 00:23:46.490
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.820 --> 00:23:46.490
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.590 --> 00:23:49.490
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.590 --> 00:23:49.490
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:52.100
Without each other.

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:52.100
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.190 --> 00:23:53.060
You should

00:23:52.190 --> 00:23:53.060
Soshite

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:58.560
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:58.560
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.670 --> 00:24:02.350
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.670 --> 00:24:02.350
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.410 --> 00:24:08.060
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.410 --> 00:24:08.060
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.140 --> 00:24:14.550
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.140 --> 00:24:14.550
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.610 --> 00:24:20.350
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.610 --> 00:24:20.350
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.830 --> 00:24:26.330
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.830 --> 00:24:26.330
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:34.800 --> 00:24:36.160
I want to go see!

00:24:42.420 --> 00:24:44.140
Bling!

00:24:46.730 --> 00:24:48.440
What are you doing!?

00:24:49.150 --> 00:24:52.200
Take Me to Kitano.

